§ `Regulation 32`

#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week of 3 Oct 2016 (tax year 2016)`
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week in the tax year he reaches the woman-equivalent age (2015)`
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week in the tax year before (2014)`)
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week of 5 Jun 2017 (tax year 2017)`
-- (2)(b): a year "prior to" the one in which he attains 65.
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week in the tax year he turns 65 (2018)`)
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week in the tax year after he turns 65 (2019)`)
-- (1): born before 6 October 1953.
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 6 Oct 1953`)
-- (3): "more than 182 days".
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, absent 182 days`
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `man born 5 Oct 1953, absent 183 days`)
-- (4): a self-employed man needs (a) or (b).
#ASSERT NOT (`regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `self-employed man, neither condition`)
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `self-employed man, condition (a)`
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `self-employed man, condition (b)`
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the man is credited with earnings for the week` `employed man, conditions (a) and (b) false`
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the earnings credited` `man born 5 Oct 1953, week of 3 Oct 2016 (tax year 2016)` EQUALS JUST 123
#ASSERT `regulation 32(1): the earnings credited` `man born 6 Oct 1953` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Regulation 33: the same as regulation 28 for years from 6 April 2016`

